Given circuit is shown below. <img src="img/73d81fc56e92a103.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" style="width:min(100%,224px)"> Writing KVL in Loop--1, \[-V_1+1(I_1-I_2)+2(I_1-I_3)=0\] \[V_1=3I_1-I_2-2I_3
\tag{i}\] Applying KVL in Loop--2, \[-V_2+I_2+1(I_2-I_3)+1(I_2-I_1)=0\] \[V_2=-I_1+3I_2-I_3
\tag{ii}\] Applying KVL in Loop--3, \[V_3+2(I_3-I_1)+1(I_3-I_2)=0\] \[-V_3=-2I_1-I_2+3I_3
\tag{iii}\] Writing (i), (ii) and (iii) in matrix form, \[\begin{bmatrix}
3 &amp; -1 &amp; -2\\
-1 &amp; 3 &amp; -1\\
-2 &amp; -1 &amp; 3
\end{bmatrix}
\begin{bmatrix}
I_1\\
I_2\\
I_3
\end{bmatrix}
=
\begin{bmatrix}
V_1\\
V_2\\
-V_3
\end{bmatrix}\] Hence, \[\boxed{\text{(C) $\begin{bmatrix}
3 &amp; -1 &amp; -2\\
-1 &amp; 3 &amp; -1\\
-2 &amp; -1 &amp; 3
\end{bmatrix}
\begin{bmatrix}
I_1\\ I_2\\ I_3
\end{bmatrix}
=
\begin{bmatrix}
V_1\\ V_2\\ -V_3
\end{bmatrix}$}}\]

